    name: Blast Finish
    description: 'Tier 1: Complete 5 levels using Color Blast as the finishing action.

      Tier
      2: Complete 15 levels using Color Blast as the finishing action.

      Tier
      3: Complete 30 levels using Color Blast as the finishing action.'
    category: Power-Ups
    iconKey: achievement.054
    disabledReason: 'Supply unavailable under current production defaults: only three
      of each power-up are granted once, and no player-facing replenishment or reward
      distributor exists. The first milestone exceeds that lifetime supply. Tracking
      and original thresholds are implemented; enable after legitimate stock replenishment
      is connected. Debug stock grants and unlimited mode are ineligible.'
